to this question by playing the game \u201cMental State. Game One\u201d.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A combination of different game genres<br></li><li>An unusual and mystery atmosphere<br></li><li>A cryptic, shrouded in secrets plot<br></li><li>An unusual &quot;System of thoughts&quot; that affects the mental state of the hero and the gameplay as a whole<br></li><li>Diverse interaction with objects and fantastic devices</li></ul>",
